### ========================================
### AUTHENTICATION MICROSERVICE ROUTES
### ========================================

### 1. Register the Canteen Owner (Admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Seblak RafiLinux",
  "password": "Rafi6767!",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. Login to get the JWT Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Seblak RafiLinux",
  "password": "Rafi6767!"
}

### 3. Try to access Dashboard WITHOUT a token (Should fail with 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/dashboard


### 4. Access Dashboard WITH the token (Replace token after Bearer)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/dashboard 
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MzcsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiU2VibGFrIFJhZmlMaW51eCIsInJvbGUiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc5NDM1NzkwOSwiZXhwIjoxNzk0NDQ0MzA5fQ.CIq8Mw_dlj-F9QINN547QyNc2KEQVSDLx_12QIzqLf8

### 5. Register a Customer (User Role)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Tegai",
  "password": "telkom6767",
  "role": "user"
}

### 6. Login as the Customer to get the Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Tegay",
  "password": "telkom6767"
}

### 7. Try to access the Dashboard as a Customer (Should fail with 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MzgsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoiVGVnYXkiLCJyb2xlIjoidXNlciIsImlhdCI6MTc5NDM1Nzk2NCwiZXhwIjoxNzk0NDQ0MzY0fQ.b-WrcvrYJhuxoyN3Bin2B4RrnHadWpRqxsTXySDoyKE

### ========================================
### CANTEEN MAIN MICROSERVICE ROUTES
### ========================================

### 8. Add Seblak Mi (Admin Route)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/canteen/menu
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Seblak Mi",
  "price": 18000,
  "category": "Food"
}

