### 13. Fetch Full Canteen Menu (Customer/Kiosk)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/canteen/menu

### 14. Place a Customer Order (Customer/Kiosk)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/canteen/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Tegar",
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": "650000000000000000000001",
      "name": "Seblak Komplit Super Pedas",
      "price": 18000,
      "quantity": 1
    },
    {
      "menuItemId": "650000000000000000000002",
      "name": "Es Teh Manis Jumbo",
      "price": 5000,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ],
  "totalAmount": 28000
}

### 15. View Cook Dashboard FIFO Queue (Ordered Oldest-First)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/canteen/orders/fifo